<item><title><![CDATA[Five days left: Submit October events]]></title><description><![CDATA[GULCH&#8217;s printed visual art Directory coming soon]]></description><link>https://gulchmag.substack.com/p/five-days-left-submit-october-events</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://gulchmag.substack.com/p/five-days-left-submit-october-events</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[GULCH Mag]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 11:46:38 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6ceb9d40-d182-4fb1-9379-03b3e4d98fbb_4608x2505.png" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="pullquote"><p>Less than a week left to <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd358gr2jKkY2n7cx_54GAxCYHLkQFn8i1wqAwu4ng5N39UbA/viewform?usp=header">submit your October events</a> for GULCH&#8217;s Visual Art Directory. <strong>Submissions close</strong> <strong>Sunday, September 20</strong>.</p></div><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd358gr2jKkY2n7cx_54GAxCYHLkQFn8i1wqAwu4ng5N39UbA/viewform?usp=header" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q7eK!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4b4a935d-1f03-425a-a1e7-6b10ff765085_4608x3150.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q7eK!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4b4a935d-1f03-425a-a1e7-6b10ff765085_4608x3150.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q7eK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4b4a935d-1f03-425a-a1e7-6b10ff765085_4608x3150.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q7eK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4b4a935d-1f03-425a-a1e7-6b10ff765085_4608x3150.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q7eK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4b4a935d-1f03-425a-a1e7-6b10ff765085_4608x3150.png" width="4608" height="3150" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4b4a935d-1f03-425a-a1e7-6b10ff765085_4608x3150.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:3150,&quot;width&quot;:4608,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:23950651,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd358gr2jKkY2n7cx_54GAxCYHLkQFn8i1wqAwu4ng5N39UbA/viewform?usp=header&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://gulchmag.substack.com/i/215768883?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F69e6dc4c-3d4c-42a0-96ed-82ccbd625229_4608x3150.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q7eK!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4b4a935d-1f03-425a-a1e7-6b10ff765085_4608x3150.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q7eK!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4b4a935d-1f03-425a-a1e7-6b10ff765085_4608x3150.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q7eK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4b4a935d-1f03-425a-a1e7-6b10ff765085_4608x3150.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q7eK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4b4a935d-1f03-425a-a1e7-6b10ff765085_4608x3150.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The October Directory includes openings, closings, artist and curator talks, open studios, pop-ups, and more. All Metro Atlanta, all in-person.  It&#8217;s organized by district, so somebody can flip to an area and see what&#8217;s happening. </p><div class="callout-block" data-callout="true"><h3 style="text-align: center;"><strong>&#187; &#187; <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd358gr2jKkY2n7cx_54GAxCYHLkQFn8i1wqAwu4ng5N39UbA/viewform?usp=header">Submit your event for free</a> &#171; &#171;</strong></h3></div><p>We can only print what we know about, so please share with friends and colleagues who have visual art happenings going on.</p><div><hr></div><p>We&#8217;re also taking <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/19-fyl_26ciVgjc1AlZL1zYmgy2QmmADq/view?usp=sharing">sponsorships</a> from orgs and venues that want to carry copies of the Directory. They start at $150, and include promo across our newsletter, Instagram, and website. You can check out details <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/19-fyl_26ciVgjc1AlZL1zYmgy2QmmADq/view?usp=sharing">here</a>, and reply to this email if you want to know more. </p>]]></content:encoded></item>
<item><title><![CDATA[GULCH’s October Art Directory: Submit Your Event]]></title><description><![CDATA[Atlanta's art calendar finally appears in print &#9996;&#65039;&#128125;]]></description><link>https://gulchmag.substack.com/p/gulchs-october-art-directory-submit</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://gulchmag.substack.com/p/gulchs-october-art-directory-submit</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Jasmine Shuree]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 14:53:15 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>This fall, we&#8217;re trying something new and putting our Art Calendar in print form! The booklet will map visual art institutions and events across Atlanta for the month of October, and we&#8217;d love to include your event &#128064;</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YmDM!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feea4b25f-9150-4a0c-abe6-61c8677e8e49_1768x2877.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YmDM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feea4b25f-9150-4a0c-abe6-61c8677e8e49_1768x2877.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YmDM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feea4b25f-9150-4a0c-abe6-61c8677e8e49_1768x2877.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YmDM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feea4b25f-9150-4a0c-abe6-61c8677e8e49_1768x2877.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YmDM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feea4b25f-9150-4a0c-abe6-61c8677e8e49_1768x2877.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YmDM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feea4b25f-9150-4a0c-abe6-61c8677e8e49_1768x2877.png" width="352" height="572.7252747252747" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/eea4b25f-9150-4a0c-abe6-61c8677e8e49_1768x2877.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:2369,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:352,&quot;bytes&quot;:3544435,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://gulchmag.substack.com/i/213867870?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feea4b25f-9150-4a0c-abe6-61c8677e8e49_1768x2877.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YmDM!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feea4b25f-9150-4a0c-abe6-61c8677e8e49_1768x2877.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YmDM!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feea4b25f-9150-4a0c-abe6-61c8677e8e49_1768x2877.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YmDM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feea4b25f-9150-4a0c-abe6-61c8677e8e49_1768x2877.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YmDM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feea4b25f-9150-4a0c-abe6-61c8677e8e49_1768x2877.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>We&#8217;re calling it the Atlanta Visual Art Directory. We&#8217;ll print a limited number of copies and get them into your hands the last week of September&#8212;just in time for the Atlanta Art Fair happening October 1 &#8211;&nbsp;4. </p><p>The Directory will feature galleries, museums, and artist run spaces and include exhibition openings, closing, artist talks, open studios, and the like. If you&#8217;ve got a visual art event happening in October in metro Atlanta, we want to know about it. </p><blockquote><p><strong><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd358gr2jKkY2n7cx_54GAxCYHLkQFn8i1wqAwu4ng5N39UbA/viewform?usp=header">Submit your event for free</a></strong></p></blockquote><p>Submissions will close <strong>Sunday, September 20</strong>. After that we&#8217;re locked in to finalizing layout and printing. </p><p>And a separate ask for anybody who runs a space: We&#8217;re bringing on sponsors to help cover printing costs, starting at $150. Sponsors will get print copies of the Directory to hand out at their location, a shoutout in this newsletter, and a feature on our Instagram. If you&#8217;re interested, reply to this email and I&#8217;ll provide more details. </p><p>Can&#8217;t wait to share with you!</p><p>~ Jasmine</p>]]></content:encoded></item>
<item><title><![CDATA[GULCH Mag #026: GULCH Programming]]></title><description><![CDATA[GULCH Spring programming collaborations]]></description><link>https://gulchmag.substack.com/p/gulch-mag-026-gulch-programming</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://gulchmag.substack.com/p/gulch-mag-026-gulch-programming</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[GULCH Mag]]></dc:creator><pubDate>not a date</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/827d46be-8139-43a0-a007-7be33fc301fd_2232x1162.png" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>They say the one constant is change, and that&#8217;s certainly true of leadership in the Atlanta art scene. Recently, Day &amp; Night Projects announced Makeda Jean Lewis-Kinuthia as the new Co-Director of Day &amp; Night Projects, and we couldn&#8217;t be happier. New leadership! New energy! It&#8217;s a great fit for the beloved DIY spot, and we love to see it. </p><p>This week&#8212;<a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DUWGGAKCZwe/">Navin Norling&#8217;s much anticipated solo exhibition</a> at Johnson Lowe Gallery finally opens after delays due to consecutive winter storms. The third and final iteration of the <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DTGbITFkWdq/">Hive Collective&#8217;s Pollinator series</a> promises &#8220;something that you have never seen before&#8221; at Atlanta Contemporary. SeekATL hosts a <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DUbMqQmEd-A/?hl=en&amp;img_index=1">studio visit with Atlanta icon Erik Thurmond</a>, aka Pasquale. On Saturday, the increasingly vibrant Edgewood Arts District will host a <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DU_tvNaDzZ3/?img_index=1">Edgewood Art Walk</a>, which spans one mile and includes 11 venues. It&#8217;s a packed week, and as always, you can find the full list of events on our <a href="https://www.gulchmagazine.com/">website</a>. </p><p>Also, some exciting news&#8212;GULCH is finally getting into programming! There are many incredible organizations and people in Atlanta, and we&#8217;re honored to be partnering with some of the best. Mark your calendars for Sunday, April 19 for <a href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DVEUKgADumW/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&amp;igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==">REP YOUR FLAG</a>, a dance party and market with GULCH and the legendary <a href="https://www.instagram.com/frutamami/?hl=en">Fruta Mami</a>. Later this spring, you can join GULCH and <a href="https://www.alllifeisyoga.com/">All Life is Yoga</a> for &#8220;Yoga For Artists&#8221; on May 2. We&#8217;ll also be partnering this spring with <a href="https://www.nuestracreacion.org/">Nuestra Creaci&#243;n</a> for a Creative Business Workshop, exact date TBD. Keep following us for more info and updates! </p><div><hr></div><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qwjx!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa8be7aa6-471b-40e4-b052-2cef517d8d5b_1835x386.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qwjx!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa8be7aa6-471b-40e4-b052-2cef517d8d5b_1835x386.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qwjx!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa8be7aa6-471b-40e4-b052-2cef517d8d5b_1835x386.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qwjx!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa8be7aa6-471b-40e4-b052-2cef517d8d5b_1835x386.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qwjx!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazo